# -SIP on the longitude CTYPE only: 'RA---TAN-SIP' with 'DEC--TAN'
# (synthetic, from the round-3 verifier probe p05_mixed_suffix). wcslib
# 8.10 accepts it and applies SIP (the SIP keywords alone make SIP the
# prior distortion). The two celestial CTYPEs declare different
# distortions; we refuse (PR #3 review item: validate the distortion code
# on both celestial axes).
# AP/BP are given so hdr2sky injects nothing.
# EXPECT-GO-ERROR: inconsistent distortion codes
NOTE stricter: sip_mixed_suffix
GRID 1 1024 9 1 1024 9
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 1024
NAXIS2  = 1024
CRVAL1  = 150.0
CRVAL2  = 2.0
CRPIX1  = 512.5
CRPIX2  = 512.5
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN-SIP'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN'
CD1_1   = -0.0002777
CD1_2   = 0.0
CD2_1   = 0.0
CD2_2   = 0.0002777
A_ORDER = 2
B_ORDER = 2
A_2_0   = 2e-5
A_1_1   = 1e-5
B_0_2   = 2e-5
B_1_1   = -1e-5
AP_ORDER= 1
AP_0_0  = 0.0
BP_ORDER= 1
BP_0_0  = 0.0
